{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"TIT.1.1\">1</ref> For what end Titus was left in Crete.<br/><ref to=\"TIT.1.6\">6</ref> How they that are to be chosen ministers ought to be qualified.<br/><ref to=\"TIT.1.11\">11</ref> The mouths of evil teachers to be stopped;<br/><ref to=\"TIT.1.12\">12</ref> and what manner of men they be.<br/><br/><br/>a servant.<br/><ref to=\"1CH.6.49 ROM.1.1 PHP.1.1\">1Ch 6:49; Ro 1:1; Php 1:1</ref><br/>faith.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.10.26 JHN.10.27 ACT.13.48 EPH.2.8 2TH.2.13 2TH.2.14 1TI.1.5\">Joh 10:26,27; Ac 13:48; Eph 2:8; 2Th 2:13,14; 1Ti 1:5</ref><br/>the acknowledging.<br/><ref to=\"COL.2.2 2TI.2.23 2TI.2.25 1JN.2.23\">Col 2:2; 2Ti 2:23,25; 1Jo 2:23</ref><br/>after.<br/><ref to=\"TIT.2.11 TIT.2.12 1TI.1.4 1TI.3.16 1TI.6.3 2PE.1.3 2PE.3.11\">2:11,12; 1Ti 1:4; 3:16; 6:3; 2Pe 1:3; 3:11</ref></p>"}
